WEBVTT

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.893
Also, if anyone is concerned

00:07:00.917 --> 00:07:04.018
that middle-aged women
might be underperformers,

00:07:04.042 --> 00:07:07.143
I'll just quickly add
that we looked at cognitive performance,

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:08.476
God forbid, right?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:09.934
(Laughter)

00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:11.684
Let's not do that.

00:07:11.708 --> 00:07:13.601
But we looked at cognitive performance,

00:07:13.625 --> 00:07:17.059
and we found absolutely no differences
between men and women

00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:19.684
before and after menopause.

00:07:19.708 --> 00:07:21.934
And other studies confirm this.

00:07:21.958 --> 00:07:24.768
So basically, we may be tired,

00:07:24.792 --> 00:07:26.934
but we are just as sharp.

00:07:26.958 --> 00:07:29.351
(Laughter)

00:07:29.375 --> 00:07:31.393
Get that out of the way.